# Formspree Contact Form Integration
# Get your Formspree endpoint from https://formspree.io/
# 1. Create a new form on Formspree
# 2. Copy the endpoint URL (format: https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_FORM_ID)
# 3. Set the value below in your local .env and production environment
PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_FORM_ID
